msgid "AI Advisor created a recommendation. Review the validated plan before Apply."
msgstr ""
"DI patarėjas parengė rekomendaciją. Prieš taikydami peržiūrėkite patikrintą "
"planą."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"AI-assisted Apply is blocked until a clean current-version Runtime Acceptance"
